      "localGuideInfo": "Local Guide · 663 reviews",
      "text": "It is a small Europe where you can see pretty European-style buildings, restaurants, and shops. European restaurants and dessert cafes on the main street are also good, but I recommend hidden gem, Chinese restaurants in the back alley. I happen to visit Loonfung house and cuisines there were more than expected. Wonderful place!",
